# Change Log

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.


## Version [1.0.1] - 2025-10-10

Updated to python standards.

### Added
- Proper typing for all python parts. (Cython typehinting remains frustrating)
- Proper installation through pyproject.toml, i.e., can be install with pip
- Update license stuff
- Separate source codes from modules to be installed


## Version [0.0.1] - 2023-03-28

Initial version. Semi-complete except for documented implementation.

### Added
- All Initial functions added


